        <h1 class="post-detail__title">Pantry Remodel for Installation of Food Safety Sink and Prep Area</h1>

        <div class="post-detail__featured-image">
          <img src="/assets/images/news/50348.webp" alt="Pantry Remodel for Installation of Food Safety Sink and Prep Area" loading="lazy">
